{"Title":"An Act amending the charter of the town of Swampscott","BillNumber":"H4086","DocketNumber":"HD4553","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JBA1","Name":"Jennifer Balinsky Armini","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBA1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-17T15:08:10.793"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JBA1","Name":"Jennifer Balinsky Armini","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JBA1","ResponseDate":"2023-08-17T15:08:10.7933333"},{"Id":"BPC0","Name":"Brendan P. Crighton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BPC0","ResponseDate":"2023-08-29T09:47:24.89"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"BPC0","Name":"Brendan P. Crighton","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BPC0","ResponseDate":"2023-08-17T15:08:10.793"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4086/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Armini of Marblehead and Senator Crighton, a joint petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 4086) of Jennifer Balinsky Armini and Brendan P. Crighton (by vote of the town) that the town of Swampscott be authorized to amend the charter of said town to change the board of selectmen to a select board.  Municipalities and Regional Government.  [Local Approval Received.]","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 2-1 of chapter 2 of the charter of the town of Swampscott, which is on file in the office of the archivist of the commonwealth, as provided in section 12 of chapter 43B of the General Laws, is hereby amended by striking out the word “selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 2-1 of said chapter 2 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 3. Section 2-2 of said chapter 2 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 4. Section 2-3 of said chapter 2 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 5. Said section 2-3 of said chapter 2 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 6. The first paragraph of section 2-6 of said chapter 2 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the word “selectmen”, each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 7. The last paragraph of said section 2-6 of said chapter 2 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 8. Subsection (b) of section 2-9 of said chapter 2 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 9. Section 3-1 of chapter 3 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “Board of Selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- Select Board.\r\n\tSECTION 10. Said section 3-1 of said chapter 3 of said charter is hereby further amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 11. Section 3-2A of said chapter 3 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 12. Subsection (b) of Section 3-3 of said chapter 3 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 13. Subsection (b) of section 3-4 of said chapter 3 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:-  select board.\r\n\tSECTION 14. Subsection (c) of said section 3-4 of said chapter 3 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 15. Subsection (c) of section 3-5 of said chapter 3 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 16. Subsection (g) of section 4-1 of chapter 4 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 17. Subsection (h) of said section 4-1 of said chapter 4 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.  \r\n\tSECTION 18. Chapter 5 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the title and inserting in place thereof the following title:- SELECT BOARD.\r\n\tSECTION 19. Subsection (a) of section 5-1 of said chapter 5 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen”, each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 20. Subsection (b) of said section 5-1 of said chapter 5 of said charter is hereby amended by striking out the words “board of selectmen” and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 21. Subsection (c) of said section 5-1 of said chapter 5 of said charter is hereby amended by 